uriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","review_id":"kSHu8djeAiPKw_hYg71wrQ","date":"2016-07-03T17:39:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9188735485076904,"text_excerpt":"We ate here about a year ago and gave it a second try. Other than the maze like setting to get in, the place is clean with good service. I didn't get tricked into getting a souvenir beer glass this time. I had the red beans and rice with fried chicken and the other person had shrimp and grits. Both were very good, well prepared, hot and seasoned just right. The service was good without being a pain. We got our food quickly as well as our drinks. I say just ignore the shop that sells misc things and eat."},{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","review_id":"Dz1CMaYmcWjt6BBr10kFMQ","date":"2014-10-05T05:23:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9178657531738281,"text_excerpt":"My husband brought me here for my birthday dinner. I wasn't all that excited at the prospect because it was a chain restaurant and I felt that living in NOLA we had much better places to eat. I gave in and I am so glad I did! The food was amazing, everything from appetizers to desert. I mean just truly good food. Our waiter was just the nicest man and we received excellent service. The atmosphere and decor was really nice and interesting if you've ever seen the movie Forest Gump. I look forward to visiting again."},{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","review_id":"hoApdxQnp45AzHiWI7WF7w","date":"2011-04-06T18:42:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9162354469299316,"text_excerpt":"We stopped to eat here partly because of the name/theme, and because we were having a hard time picking a place to eat dinner (our main requirement was simply somewhere with seafood). They sat us on the balcony, which offered a nice view of Decatur Street as the sun went down. The two of us split the Bourbon Street Mahi Mahi and the \"I'm Stuffed\" Shrimp. Both were delicious, although I think we both agreed the mahi mahi was the favorite because of that bourbon sauce. Yum. I didn't check the gift shop to see if they sold it by the gallon; if they don't, they should! Overall, it was a fun place to relax for a little while, play some Forrest Gump trivia with the server & the table next to us..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","photo_id":"iZx6D6FuBqEhl5UssnxGzw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/iZx6D6FuBqEhl5UssnxGzw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8830170035362244},{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","photo_id":"WqCa2Qhs5gORCf0u34I-8A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WqCa2Qhs5gORCf0u34I-8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8262091875076294},{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","photo_id":"XLLZ7G8-6lLGBmI1APjdgw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XLLZ7G8-6lLGBmI1APjdgw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8048902750015259},{"business_id":"0eOeiknYEwjFOywy9pe4RQ","photo_id":"aH7z2Cy6vy8yT0GPZRLmJg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aH7z2Cy6vy8yT0GPZRLmJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7950494289398193}]},"notebook_case":null}
